\f1\b \cf0 Question:
\f0\b0  Compare Half Adder, Full Adder, Ripple Carry Adder, and Carry Look-ahead Adder. Include their implementations, advantages, and disadvantages.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 Answer:
\f0\b0 \
From Slide 5: "The basic building blocks of an ALU in digital computers are Adders. Types of Basic Adders are Half Adder and Full Adder. Parallel adders are nothing but cascade of full adders."\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

